OL,3,GNEWSAMissing Lillia reunited with mum
OL,4,Aafter eight days
OL,5,
OL,6,FA schoolgirl who went missing has been
OL,7,Freunited with her mother after "eight
OL,8,Fdays of torture" for the family, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FLillia, 13, from Bolton, was last seen
OL,12,Fby her family on September 11, sparking
OL,13,Fa major search operation
OL,15,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP)
OL,16,Fconfirmed the teenager had been found
OL,17,Fsafe and well in the city centre on
OL,18,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
