OL,3,GNEWSAMissing Lillia reunited with mum
OL,4,Aafter eight days
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers on patrol in the city centre
OL,7,Ffound her, GMP said. This came hours
OL,8,Fafter the force had issued a CCTV clip
OL,9,Fof Lillia near Manchester Piccadilly
OL,10,Fstation to assist the search.
